&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results! Geotab is seeking a Head of MyG Core Workflows who will own the MyGeotab workflows customers depend on, ensuring their usability, reliability, and evolution while enabling other product domains to build on shared capabilities. If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;The Head of MyG Core Workflows owns the MyGeotab workflows every customer depends on and is accountable for their usability, reliability, and evolution, both as customer-facing product and as shared capability other domains build on. The scope spans driver messaging; notifications (types, templates, recipients, and delivery channels, including reliability and latency); exception rules, stock rules, and how exceptions appear across reports and the map; system settings; the group hierarchy and its UI; and investigations that reconstruct what happened in context. This leader sets the vision for these workflows and how other domains build on rules, notifications, and groups, and answers to MyGeotab customers, the domain&#39;s primary customers, and the product domains that depend on it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Key Accountabilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;People leadership, development, and organizational health.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;AI-native product development lifecycle, including AI-assisted modernization of legacy MyGeotab workflow pages.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Cross-domain communication and coordination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Product ownership and engineering standards for MyGeotab core workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Customer outcomes and reliability, with MyGeotab customers as primary customers and dependent product domains as internal customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Product Engineering &amp;amp; Technical Standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Define, maintain, and evolve the technical standards, architectural patterns, and shared components for the domain&#39;s workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Own the reliability, scalability, and performance of messaging, notification, rules UI, and exception services; accountable to customer-facing SLOs for notification delivery success and latency. Own regression protection and VIP-customer test coverage so no release silently breaks customers&#39; rules or notifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Lead the identification and resolution of technical debt, security vulnerabilities, and compliance requirements in the domain, including the integrity of group-based data visibility, in coordination with Core API and Security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Shape and communicate the vision for core workflows to solution and segment domains; publish and maintain the capability contract for rules, notifications, and groups — intended use patterns, integration standards, and system constraints — so consuming domains can build on reusable platform capability correctly and confidently; keep platform tooling decisions aligned with the needs of consuming domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Modernize legacy MyGeotab workflow pages to the Zenith/React stack, using AI-assisted conversion where practical, while preserving the behaviour customers depend on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Customer Outcomes &amp;amp; Enablement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Treat product domain teams as internal customers of rules, notifications, and groups; proactively understand their evolving needs and remove blockers. MyGeotab customers remain the domain&#39;s primary customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Own product discovery and the domain roadmap with the domain&#39;s product manager and designers; prioritize transparently based on customer impact, reliability, and the needs of dependent domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Define and measure customer and product metrics as primary success indicators: notification delivery success and latency, exception-to-notification time, rules-related incidents and PMIRs, support ticket volume per feature, feature adoption and usage, and investigation escalation accuracy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Establish feedback loops with peer Heads of Domain to capture platform gaps and translate them into actionable improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Provide technical consultation and guidance to product domain teams on the capabilities and constraints of rules, notifications, and groups.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Manage external delivery dependencies (email, SMS, voice, and webhook providers) and internal dependencies (Gateway/embedded for in-vehicle feedback, Drive and in-cab devices for messaging, the rules engine, Video, and Safety) — integration standards and the risk each dependency creates for reliability and roadmap.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;People Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Provide career development support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Conduct regular 1:1s and performance conversations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Support employees through KPA goal-setting and development planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Oversee the hiring, onboarding, development, and performance management of a cross-functional team consisting of product managers, designers, and product engineers or other skills as required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Support company-wide strategic initiatives including AI adoption, security posture, accessibility, and compliance programs as directed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Identify growth opportunities and training aligned to domain needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Foster a high-trust, high-accountability team culture that values craftsmanship, documentation, and service mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Manage team capacity and resource allocation across roadmap initiatives, customer commitments, and support obligations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Domain Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Translate board-level strategic direction into a coherent domain roadmap and execution plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Own the domain investment portfolio within approved parameters; make principled trade-offs between new capability, reliability, and technical debt reduction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Lead annual planning processes including headcount, budget, and OKR input to department leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Track and report on domain health, customer outcomes, and team delivery through defined KPIs; surface risks and recommendations to board leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Cross-Domain Coordination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Contributes domain expertise to cross-domain initiatives when assigned. Maintains clear, documented ownership boundaries with adjacent domains — notably the rules engine (evaluation and processing), Safety (collision reconstruction and post-collision workflows), and Geospatial (zones).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product domain leads to align core workflow capabilities with product roadmaps and delivery timelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Participate in department planning forums as a subject-matter authority for MyGeotab core workflows; represent domain constraints and opportunities clearly to board leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Board Relationship &amp;amp; Accountability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Own and execute the domain strategy within board-set direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Make investment cases to the board for resourcing, headcount, and capability investment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Operate under structured board coaching with increasing autonomy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab First Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Champions a Geotab First approach to leadership by putting the success of the broader organization ahead of siloed or individual domain wins.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Beyond leading their own domain, actively fosters collaboration, builds consensus, and works effectively across diverse internal and external teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Seeks out different perspectives before decisions are made, shares credit and information openly, and treats other domains&#39; priorities as shared priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Drives collective success through strong interpersonal relationships, shared goals, and a willingness to flex personal or domain agendas in service of the company&#39;s broader objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Equivalent combination of education and work experience in a related field may be substituted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;5+ years of relevant industry experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in SaaS or web product engineering or product management, ideally on configuration-heavy, multi-tenant products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;3+ years in technical leadership roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;3+ years of leadership experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;1+ years leading a cross-functional team of product managers, designers, and engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Deep technical and product expertise in configuration-heavy, multi-tenant B2B SaaS workflows; experience with event, alerting, and multi-channel notification systems (delivery, templating, rate limiting).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead through influence in a matrixed or shared-services organizational model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Strong product sense and UX judgment — able to make complex configuration (rules, groups, notifications) powerful for large fleets yet simple for small ones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Strong systems thinking — ability to anticipate how platform decisions ripple across multiple consuming teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Proficient in defining and tracking SLOs, customer-facing product metrics, and reliability indicators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Ability to shape and evangelize a vision for core workflows across consuming domains — communicating intended use patterns, constraints, and trade-offs of reusable capability so solution and segment teams adopt it correctly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills; able to translate technical concepts into customer and business impact for non-technical peers and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Experience operating in evolving organizational structures with ambiguity and shifting priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Familiarity with modern engineering practices: CI/CD, DevSecOps, cloud-native architecture, observability, and agile delivery. Knowledge of telematics or fleet management is an asset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;AI Nativity: Ability to redesign the domain&#39;s workflows around AI to compress effort.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Change Readiness: Lead change through a larger domain; manage resistance and sustain momentum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;If you got this far, we hope you&#39;re feeling excited about this role! Even if you don&#39;t feel you meet every single requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: Geotab does not accept agency resumes and is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes. Please do not forward resumes to Geotab employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Why job seekers choose Geotab:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
